OL,3,AFormer minister calls for phone tech to
OL,4,Ablock live-streamed child sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer safeguarding minister Jess
OL,7,FPhillips has joined calls from
OL,8,Fcampaigners for the government to back
OL,9,Fnew technology that blocks the
OL,10,Flive-streaming of child sexual abuse.
OL,12,FThe UK National Crime Agency has
OL,13,Fflagged the UK as the third biggest
OL,14,Fmarket in the world for live-streamed
OL,15,Fabuse, where children are sexually
OL,16,Fabused live on camera to order.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
