OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFormer minister calls for phone tech to
OL,4,Ablock live-streamed child sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevice-level blockers can prevent this
OL,7,Fmaterial being filmed and viewed on
OL,8,Fsmartphones, laptops and tablets in the
OL,9,Ffirst place, Phillips said, at the
OL,10,Flaunch of a policy report in
OL,11,FParliament.
OL,13,FAnti-abuse campaigners claim keeping
OL,14,Fthe technology at device level
OL,15,Fmaintains privacy and encryption. Civil
OL,16,Fliberties campaigners Big Brother Watch
OL,17,Fdispute this.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
